{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-desktop-tools#card-zh","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-desktop-tools","commit":"97ad19823db9305fc9291a7a7d94f41fd63d256b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-tools 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 Windows 桌面自动化插件，通过五个 DSH 工具连接桌面引擎，读取可见窗口与 UI Automation 控件，并在控件不可用时提供截图操作。它支持查询窗口、生成控件快照、截取窗口或局部区域、按控件引用点击，以及向控件输入文本或凭据。操作可使用语义控件方式，也可在界面不暴露控件时根据截图定位。适合需要让 DSH Agent 与本机 Windows 应用交互的用户。运行需要 Windows、PowerShell 7 和交互式桌面；写操作默认关闭，可在插件设置中启用。不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:14-19","index.js:33-47","config.js:4"]}
{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-desktop-tools#card-en","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-desktop-tools","commit":"97ad19823db9305fc9291a7a7d94f41fd63d256b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-desktop-tools lets DSH agents inspect Windows apps through window lists, UI Automation snapshots, and screenshots, then click controls or type text. It needs Windows, PowerShell 7, and an interactive desktop. Writes are off by default; no API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:14-19","index.js:33-47","config.js:4"]}
