{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-desktop-tools#feature-1","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-desktop-tools","commit":"97ad19823db9305fc9291a7a7d94f41fd63d256b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-tools 的功能「窗口与控件查看」：列出可见窗口并读取窗口控件快照。调用 desktop_windows 查找窗口，再用 desktop_snapshot 获取当前控件及引用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:15-16"]}
